From dd37a280aa4a394861145d99321e0f118e77dc4d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: iOSNJBrepo <42407902+iOSNJBrepo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 19:47:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] uke: Port the full macOS 26.5 boot to the Xiaomi Pad 7

Match the xiaomi,uke device tree, scale the GOP display, and give the
full OS volatile RAM overlays for the OS and ISC windows. Add the uke
kernel patches for WindowServer crash reports, UI page traces, the
unsealed root and non-fatal critical process exits, and the macoslog
layout and recovery configs this port uses.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
